uisq-f: floor(sqrt(x)), for x from 0 to 999.
Cells 50-98. To call it, load x into the accumulator and JMP 50.
It returns floor(sqrt(x)) in the accumulator.
It overwrites its own cells and cell 99.
Size 49 cells. It runs at most 100 instructions, 32.4 on average, counted from cell 50 to the return jump in cell 98.
Exact over the domain.

